  "docText": [
    "SOLAR®",
    "Biamp Design System",
    "1.0",
    "Toast",
    "Description",
    "Transient notification for background operation results. Auto-dismisses after 4–7 seconds. Use for async outcomes — never for critical errors requiring confirmation.",
    "Statuses",
    "neutral   Informational, low urgency.\ninfo      Tip, update, or non-blocking hint.\nsuccess   Operation completed ('File saved').\nwarning   Caution or partial success.\ndanger    Operation failed. Stays longer (7s+) or until dismissed.",
    "Timing",
    "Default dismiss at 4s for neutral/success/info.\nWarning 6s. Danger 7s+ or manual dismiss.\nPause on hover/focus — resume on leave.",
    "Labels & Content",
    "Lead with the outcome: 'Presentation saved' not 'Success'.\nOne sentence. Add one optional action ('Undo', 'View').\nNever stack multiple actions.",
    "Rules",
    "DO   Use for async background results\nDO   Pair with StatusIndicator icon\nDO   Pause dismiss timer on hover\nDO   Stack newer toasts on top",
    "DON'T   Use for confirmations (use Dialog)\nDON'T   Pack multiple actions\nDON'T   Show more than 3 toasts at once\nDON'T   Keep success toasts on screen > 5s"
  ],
  "pageContext": null
